  (text "U16 D=1, PRE_N=1. NRST/PC3 low clears Q through U17.\nCT through100k to VDD: RESET_N stays low180..420ms after MR release.\nReset release alone does not restore LCD power; a NEW PC4 edge is required.\nQ controls TPS22919; Q AND delayed-Q drives U21 EN through U23 on sheet10.\nLock: PC4 low, PC3 low, wait500ms. Restart: PC3 high, wait500ms,\nPC4 high, wait200ms, then full LCD initialization. Any I/O fault -> OFF.\nLCD rail is switched SYS; A/B level buffering isolates the3.3V MCU bus.\nPhysical clearing, injection, timing and power qualification NOT_RUN."
    (at 210 97 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.3 1.3)
      )
    )
    (uuid "cfddf269-2d7a-5068-94f7-2ed77ef05b64")
  )
)
